doc: ExtRepeatOptional: an OpRepeatWhile body's RepeatOptional$ election (gorge effRepeat's repeat_optional "Repeat this process?"). B.N 0 at the body's head: C is the pass's progress condition, and a pass that starts without it is the last one, no election follows it (gorge's changed-nothing shortcut, CR 732.2a). B.N 1 at the body's tail: unless the pass was the last, the resolving controller is asked yes / no (ChGenConfirm); a no ends the loop. dirac/act_repeatoptional.go.
